[2026-03-16T04:02:45.193Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013sergTJ4AtTkzY867PDhmp","type":"tool_result","content":"366:<!-- Components: ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard -->\n398:#### Test: Property header displays title, location, rating summary, and host info\n399:- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with title \"Luxury Villa in Bali\", city \"Ubud\", country \"Indonesia\", an average rating of 4.7 from 23 reviews, hosted by \"Jane Host\" with an avatar.\n400:- **Expected:** The property header shows the title \"Luxury Villa in Bali\", location \"Ubud, Indonesia\", a star icon with \"4.7\" and \"(23 reviews)\", and the host name \"Jane Host\" with their avatar image.\n411:#### Test: Property header displays host avatar as clickable element\n412:- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page. The host has an avatar_url set.\n413:- **Expected:** The host's avatar image is displayed as a small circular image next to the host name. The host name is displayed next to the avatar.\n515:#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n516:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as the host of the current property. Dates and guests are selected.\n589:### Component: HostInfoCard\n591:#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n592:- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id`. The property host has name \"Jane Host\", an avatar_url, bio \"Superhostess who loves sharing her properties\", and created_at \"2023-06-15\".\n593:- **Expected:** The host info card displays: the host's avatar image, name \"Jane Host\", bio text \"Superhostess who loves sharing her properties\", and \"Member since June 2023\" (formatted from created_at).\n595:#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n596:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has 5 active property listings.\n597:- **Expected:** The host info card shows \"5 listings\" (or similar format like \"5 properties\").\n599:#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n600:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has avatar_url set to null.\n603:#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n604:- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has bio set to null.\n605:- **Expected:** The host info card displays the host name, avatar, and member since date. The bio area is either not shown or displays a default message. No empty or broken layout.\n754:## Page: Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n760:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users\n762:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n763:- **Expected:** The app redirects the user to `/login`. The Host Dashboard is not rendered.\n765:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n766:- **Initial state:** A user is logged in with `is_host` set to false.\n767:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n768:- **Expected:** The page displays a message indicating the user is not a host (e.g., \"You need to become a host to access this page\") with a link or button to navigate to their profile page (`/profile`) where they can become a host.\n771:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with 5 active properties and 1 inactive property in the database.\n772:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n776:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host. Their properties have 3 bookings with status \"confirmed\", 2 with status \"pending\", and 4 with status \"completed\".\n777:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n781:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host. Their properties have completed bookings with total_price values of $500, $750, and $1200.\n782:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n786:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host. Their properties have reviews with overall ratings of 4, 5, 3, and 5.\n787:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n790:#### Test: Stats overview shows zeros for a new host with no data\n791:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with no properties, no bookings, and no reviews.\n792:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n795:#### Test: Host Dashboard displays navigation tabs for Listings and Bookings\n796:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host.\n797:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting`.\n801:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host and on `/hosting` with the \"Listings\" tab active.\n807:#### Test: Listings tab displays host's properties in a grid\n808:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with 3 active properties: \"Beach House\" ($150/night), \"Mountain Cabin\" ($200/night), \"City Loft\" ($120/night).\n809:- **Action:** User navigates to `/hosting` (Listings tab is active by default).\n813:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with a property: title \"Beach House\", price $150/night, city \"Malibu\", 4.5 average rating, 10 reviews, active status.\n817:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with a property (id \"prop-123\").\n819:- **Expected:** The app navigates to `/properties/prop-123` where the host can view and edit their property details.\n822:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with an active property \"Beach House\".\n837:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with an inactive property \"Old Cabin\".\n841:#### Test: Listings tab shows empty state for host with no properties\n842:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with no properties.\n846:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host.\n850:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with two active properties.\n856:#### Test: Bookings tab displays table of bookings for host's properties\n857:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host. Their properties have bookings from various guests.\n862:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host. A booking exists: property \"Beach House\", guest \"Alice Smith\", check-in \"2026-07-01\", check-out \"2026-07-05\", 2 guests, total $750, status \"confirmed\".\n866:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab.\n867:- **Expected:** Filter controls are visible above the table allowing the host to filter by status: \"All\", \"Pending\", \"Confirmed\", \"Cancelled\", \"Completed\". \"All\" is selected by default.\n870:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. Bookings exist with statuses \"pending\", \"confirmed\", and \"completed\".\n875:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n880:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n885:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n899:#### Test: Host can confirm a pending booking\n900:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. A booking with status \"pending\" for guest \"Bob\" at property \"Beach House\" is displayed.\n904:#### Test: Host can cancel a pending booking\n905:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. A pending booking is displayed.\n907:- **Expected:** A confirmation dialog appears asking the host to confirm cancellation. The dialog shows the guest name, property, and dates for context.\n919:#### Test: Host can cancel a confirmed booking\n920:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. A booking with status \"confirmed\" is displayed.\n925:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. Bookings exist with statuses \"completed\" and \"cancelled\".\n929:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with properties but no bookings.\n945:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Listings tab.\n1092:- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host. User has already published one listing successfully.\n1098:<!-- Components: ProfileForm, BecomeHostButton, UserReviewsList -->\n1157:### Component: BecomeHostButton\n1159:#### Test: Become a Host button is visible for non-host users\n1160:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false`.\n1162:- **Expected:** A \"Become a Host\" button is visible on the profile page.\n1164:#### Test: Become a Host button is hidden for existing hosts\n1165:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `true`.\n1167:- **Expected:** The \"Become a Host\" button is NOT visible on the profile page.\n1169:#### Test: Clicking Become a Host sets user as host\n1170:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`.\n1171:- **Action:** User clicks the \"Become a Host\" button.\n1172:- **Expected:** A confirmation dialog appears (e.g., \"Are you sure you want to become a host?\"). User confirms. A `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` request is sent. Upon success, the button disappears, a success message is shown (e.g., \"You are now a host!\"), and the Redux user state updates `is_host` to `true`. The \"Hosting\" link becomes available in the navigation sidebar.\n1174:#### Test: Cancel Become a Host confirmation dialog\n1175:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`. The \"Become a Host\" button is visible.\n1176:- **Action:** User clicks the \"Become a Host\" button, then clicks \"Cancel\" in the confirmation dialog.\n1177:- **Expected:** The dialog closes. No API call is made. The \"Become a Host\" button remains visible. `is_host` remains `false`.\n1179:#### Test: Become a Host button appearance\n1180:- **Initial state:** User is logged in with `is_host` set to `false` and on `/profile`.\n1182:- **Expected:** The \"Become a Host\" button is styled with the coral/red accent color (#FF5A5F), has clear text reading \"Become a Host\", and is visually prominent on the page.\n1207:- **Initial state:** User is logged in and has written a review with rating 5, comment \"Amazing stay! The host was very welcoming.\", for property \"Beach Villa\", dated \"2026-01-15\".\n1209:- **Expected:** The review card displays: property title \"Beach Villa\", 5 filled stars, comment text \"Amazing stay! The host was very welcoming.\", and date \"Jan 15, 2026\".\n1330:- **Action:** User types \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\" in the comment text area.\n1331:- **Expected:** The text area displays the typed text \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01S6e6eLSzEfJMhS9BRQEJGp","session_id":"89faff73-b689-4266-95e8-94a07c37d050","uuid":"bce32072-1959-4433-9baf-cd77189c308a"}
