[2026-03-16T04:03:08.273Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S6e6eLSzEfJMhS9BRQEJGp","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me provide a comprehensive summary:\n\n## Airbnb Clone App - Complete Overview\n\n### 1. Documentation Files\n\n**docs/plan.md** - Contains the project polish checklist:\n- Accessibility (✓ all pages completed, including HostDashboard)\n- Responsive UI (in progress - HostDashboard, UserProfile, and WriteReview still need responsive improvements)\n- Performance (PaginateAPIs not yet implemented)\n\n**docs/tests.md** - Comprehensive 1300+ line test specification covering:\n- All pages and components including detailed Host Dashboard tests (lines 754-945)\n- Test cases for StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, and AddListingForm components\n- Test scenarios for property listing management, booking confirmations, deactivations, and new listing creation\n\n### 2. Host Dashboard Page Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx`\n\nThe main Host Dashboard page component that:\n- Requires user to be logged in (redirects to `/login` if not)\n- Requires `is_host: true` status (shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts)\n- Displays stats overview, tabs for Listings/Bookings\n- Manages tab state and handles add listing form\n\n### 3. Host Dashboard Sub-Components\n\nThe Host Dashboard uses four key sub-components:\n\n**StatsOverview** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/StatsOverview.tsx`)\n- Displays 4 stat cards in a responsive grid:\n  - Total Listings (with Home icon)\n  - Active Bookings (with Calendar icon)\n  - Total Earnings (with DollarSign icon)\n  - Average Rating (with Star icon)\n- Shows loading skeleton state\n- Accessible with ARIA labels\n\n**ListingsTab** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ListingsTab.tsx`)\n- Grid display of host's properties (responsive: 1 col mobile, 2 cols tablet, 3 cols desktop)\n- Each listing card shows: image, title, city, price/night, rating/review count, active/inactive status badge\n- Action buttons: Edit (navigates to property detail), Deactivate/Activate\n- Confirmation dialog for deactivation with accessibility features\n- Empty state with \"Add Your First Listing\" CTA\n- \"Add Listing\" button in header\n\n**BookingsTab** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx`)\n- Filter controls for status: All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed\n- Table display with columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n- Status badges with color coding\n- Action buttons for pending bookings (Confirm, Cancel)\n- Cancel button for confirmed bookings\n- Confirmation dialog for cancellations with booking details\n- Empty state message\n- Responsive table with horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n**AddListingForm** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx`)\n- Multi-step form (7 steps total) for creating new properties\n- Steps include: property type, location/address, capacity, amenities, photos, pricing, description\n- Address autocomplete via Nominatim API\n- Image gallery with carousel navigation\n- Amenities selection\n- Form validation and submission\n\n### 4. App File Structure\n\n```\n/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/\n├── src/\n│   ├── pages/                    # Page components (7 total)\n│   │   ├── HostDashboard.tsx     # Host Dashboard page\n│   │   ├── Home.tsx\n│   │   ├── Login.tsx\n│   │   ├── MyTrips.tsx\n│   │   ├── Profile.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyDetail.tsx\n│   │   └── WriteReview.tsx\n│   │\n│   ├── components/               # Reusable UI components (35 total)\n│   │   ├── StatsOverview.tsx\n│   │   ├── ListingsTab.tsx\n│   │   ├── BookingsTab.tsx\n│   │   ├── AddListingForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyGrid.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyHeader.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyInfo.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyDescription.tsx\n│   │   ├── AmenitiesList.tsx\n│   │   ├── ImageGallery.tsx\n│   │   ├── ReviewsSection.tsx\n│   │   ├── HostInfoCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── BookingCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── TripCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── TripsTabs.tsx\n│   │   ├── FiltersPanel.tsx\n│   │   ├── CategoryFilter.tsx\n│   │   ├── SearchBar.tsx\n│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx\n│   │   ├── Footer.tsx\n│   │   ├── Pagination.tsx\n│   │   ├── LoginForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── RegisterForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── AuthToggle.tsx\n│   │   ├── ProfileForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── BecomeHostButton.tsx\n│   │   ├── UserReviewsList.tsx\n│   │   ├── ReviewForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── RatingSliders.tsx\n│   │   ├── FavoriteButton.tsx\n│   │   ├── CancelBookingDialog.tsx\n│   │   └── PropertyBookingContext.tsx\n│   │\n│   ├── slices/                   # Redux slices (9 total)\n│   │   ├── hostSlice.ts          # Host-related state & thunks\n│   │   ├── authSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── propertiesSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── propertyDetailSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── bookingsSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── favoritesSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── amenitiesSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── reviewFormSlice.ts\n│   │   └── userReviewsSlice.ts\n│   │\n│   ├── App.tsx                   # Main app component with routing\n│   ├── main.tsx                  # React DOM entry point\n│   ├── store.ts                  # Redux store configuration\n│   └── index.css                 # Global styles\n│\n├── docs/\n│   ├── plan.md                   # Project plan & checklist\n│   └── tests.md                  # Comprehensive test specifications\n│\n├── tests/                        # Playwright E2E tests\n├── playwright.config.ts          # Playwright configuration\n├── vite.config.ts               # Vite build configuration\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json\n```\n\n### 5. Host Dashboard Data Flow\n\nThe HostDashboard component uses Redux for state management via `hostSlice.ts`:\n\n**Async Thunks (from hostSlice):**\n- `fetchHostStats` - Gets stats from `/api/host-stats?host_id=`\n- `fetchHostListings` - Gets properties from `/api/host-listings?host_id=`\n- `fetchHostBookings` - Gets bookings from `/api/host-bookings?host_id=`\n- `deactivateProperty` - Calls DELETE on property\n- `activateProperty` - Calls PUT to reactivate property\n- `updateHostBookingStatus` - Updates booking status (confirm/cancel)\n- `createProperty` - Creates new property (AddListingForm)\n\n**State Structure (HostState):**\n```typescript\n{\n  stats: HostStats,        // totalListings, activeBookings, totalEarnings, avgRating, reviewCount\n  listings: Property[],    // Array of host's properties\n  bookings: HostBooking[], // Array of bookings with property & guest details\n  statsLoading: boolean,\n  listingsLoading: boolean,\n  bookingsLoading: boolean,\n  error: string | null\n}\n```\n\nAll files are located in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a1e889444b78878e8 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 44674\ntool_uses: 19\nduration_ms: 30781</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"89faff73-b689-4266-95e8-94a07c37d050","uuid":"3954369b-5167-4175-bed1-32d949c4b5fc","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the airbnb clone app in the /repo/apps directory. I need to understand:\n1. Read docs/plan.md for the app\n2. Read docs/tests.md for the app \n3. Find the Host Dashboard page component(s) - search for files related to \"host\", \"dashboard\" in the app's src directory\n4. List the app's general file structure\n\nBe thorough - look at the actual page component and any sub-components used on the Host Dashboard page.","agentId":"a1e889444b78878e8","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me provide a comprehensive summary:\n\n## Airbnb Clone App - Complete Overview\n\n### 1. Documentation Files\n\n**docs/plan.md** - Contains the project polish checklist:\n- Accessibility (✓ all pages completed, including HostDashboard)\n- Responsive UI (in progress - HostDashboard, UserProfile, and WriteReview still need responsive improvements)\n- Performance (PaginateAPIs not yet implemented)\n\n**docs/tests.md** - Comprehensive 1300+ line test specification covering:\n- All pages and components including detailed Host Dashboard tests (lines 754-945)\n- Test cases for StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, and AddListingForm components\n- Test scenarios for property listing management, booking confirmations, deactivations, and new listing creation\n\n### 2. Host Dashboard Page Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx`\n\nThe main Host Dashboard page component that:\n- Requires user to be logged in (redirects to `/login` if not)\n- Requires `is_host: true` status (shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts)\n- Displays stats overview, tabs for Listings/Bookings\n- Manages tab state and handles add listing form\n\n### 3. Host Dashboard Sub-Components\n\nThe Host Dashboard uses four key sub-components:\n\n**StatsOverview** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/StatsOverview.tsx`)\n- Displays 4 stat cards in a responsive grid:\n  - Total Listings (with Home icon)\n  - Active Bookings (with Calendar icon)\n  - Total Earnings (with DollarSign icon)\n  - Average Rating (with Star icon)\n- Shows loading skeleton state\n- Accessible with ARIA labels\n\n**ListingsTab** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ListingsTab.tsx`)\n- Grid display of host's properties (responsive: 1 col mobile, 2 cols tablet, 3 cols desktop)\n- Each listing card shows: image, title, city, price/night, rating/review count, active/inactive status badge\n- Action buttons: Edit (navigates to property detail), Deactivate/Activate\n- Confirmation dialog for deactivation with accessibility features\n- Empty state with \"Add Your First Listing\" CTA\n- \"Add Listing\" button in header\n\n**BookingsTab** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx`)\n- Filter controls for status: All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed\n- Table display with columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n- Status badges with color coding\n- Action buttons for pending bookings (Confirm, Cancel)\n- Cancel button for confirmed bookings\n- Confirmation dialog for cancellations with booking details\n- Empty state message\n- Responsive table with horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n**AddListingForm** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx`)\n- Multi-step form (7 steps total) for creating new properties\n- Steps include: property type, location/address, capacity, amenities, photos, pricing, description\n- Address autocomplete via Nominatim API\n- Image gallery with carousel navigation\n- Amenities selection\n- Form validation and submission\n\n### 4. App File Structure\n\n```\n/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/\n├── src/\n│   ├── pages/                    # Page components (7 total)\n│   │   ├── HostDashboard.tsx     # Host Dashboard page\n│   │   ├── Home.tsx\n│   │   ├── Login.tsx\n│   │   ├── MyTrips.tsx\n│   │   ├── Profile.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyDetail.tsx\n│   │   └── WriteReview.tsx\n│   │\n│   ├── components/               # Reusable UI components (35 total)\n│   │   ├── StatsOverview.tsx\n│   │   ├── ListingsTab.tsx\n│   │   ├── BookingsTab.tsx\n│   │   ├── AddListingForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyGrid.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyHeader.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyInfo.tsx\n│   │   ├── PropertyDescription.tsx\n│   │   ├── AmenitiesList.tsx\n│   │   ├── ImageGallery.tsx\n│   │   ├── ReviewsSection.tsx\n│   │   ├── HostInfoCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── BookingCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── TripCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── TripsTabs.tsx\n│   │   ├── FiltersPanel.tsx\n│   │   ├── CategoryFilter.tsx\n│   │   ├── SearchBar.tsx\n│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx\n│   │   ├── Footer.tsx\n│   │   ├── Pagination.tsx\n│   │   ├── LoginForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── RegisterForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── AuthToggle.tsx\n│   │   ├── ProfileForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── BecomeHostButton.tsx\n│   │   ├── UserReviewsList.tsx\n│   │   ├── ReviewForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── RatingSliders.tsx\n│   │   ├── FavoriteButton.tsx\n│   │   ├── CancelBookingDialog.tsx\n│   │   └── PropertyBookingContext.tsx\n│   │\n│   ├── slices/                   # Redux slices (9 total)\n│   │   ├── hostSlice.ts          # Host-related state & thunks\n│   │   ├── authSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── propertiesSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── propertyDetailSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── bookingsSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── favoritesSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── amenitiesSlice.ts\n│   │   ├── reviewFormSlice.ts\n│   │   └── userReviewsSlice.ts\n│   │\n│   ├── App.tsx                   # Main app component with routing\n│   ├── main.tsx                  # React DOM entry point\n│   ├── store.ts                  # Redux store configuration\n│   └── index.css                 # Global styles\n│\n├── docs/\n│   ├── plan.md                   # Project plan & checklist\n│   └── tests.md                  # Comprehensive test specifications\n│\n├── tests/                        # Playwright E2E tests\n├── playwright.config.ts          # Playwright configuration\n├── vite.config.ts               # Vite build configuration\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json\n```\n\n### 5. Host Dashboard Data Flow\n\nThe HostDashboard component uses Redux for state management via `hostSlice.ts`:\n\n**Async Thunks (from hostSlice):**\n- `fetchHostStats` - Gets stats from `/api/host-stats?host_id=`\n- `fetchHostListings` - Gets properties from `/api/host-listings?host_id=`\n- `fetchHostBookings` - Gets bookings from `/api/host-bookings?host_id=`\n- `deactivateProperty` - Calls DELETE on property\n- `activateProperty` - Calls PUT to reactivate property\n- `updateHostBookingStatus` - Updates booking status (confirm/cancel)\n- `createProperty` - Creates new property (AddListingForm)\n\n**State Structure (HostState):**\n```typescript\n{\n  stats: HostStats,        // totalListings, activeBookings, totalEarnings, avgRating, reviewCount\n  listings: Property[],    // Array of host's properties\n  bookings: HostBooking[], // Array of bookings with property & guest details\n  statsLoading: boolean,\n  listingsLoading: boolean,\n  bookingsLoading: boolean,\n  error: string | null\n}\n```\n\nAll files are located in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`"}],"totalDurationMs":30781,"totalTokens":44674,"totalToolUseCount":19,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4830,"cache_read_input_tokens":37801,"output_tokens":2040,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4830},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
